WEBVTT

00:14.041 --> 00:18.750
Are you being oppressed right now?

00:19.250 --> 00:23.625
Bullying at school, harassment at work,

00:24.208 --> 00:27.916
unjust torment
that drives you to the edge.

00:28.500 --> 00:32.333
Do you want to become stronger?

00:33.541 --> 00:39.375
Become stronger,
and you can change your world.

01:02.291 --> 01:04.750
BEWARE OF FRAUDULENT CHARGES!

01:12.458 --> 01:13.875
SAVE ELECTRICITY

01:22.375 --> 01:25.208
MOM

01:33.375 --> 01:36.333
Good morning.
It's time for you to get going.

01:36.833 --> 01:38.583
Have fun at school!

01:41.041 --> 01:43.291
THANKS, I WILL.

01:48.083 --> 01:49.541
SHIMURA

01:52.083 --> 01:53.166
LIVESTREAM?

01:53.250 --> 01:54.208
AT LAST!

01:54.291 --> 01:55.125
WHEN?

01:55.208 --> 01:56.125
CAN'T WAIT!!!

01:56.625 --> 01:57.458
SO EXCITED!

01:57.541 --> 01:59.166
IS IT STARTING SOON?

02:03.875 --> 02:07.916
Hey guys. It's me, Hamaken.

02:08.000 --> 02:11.625
Today, we're celebrating
reaching 700,000 subscribers.

02:11.708 --> 02:15.750
For our lunchtime livestream,
we're doing a collab with Rumi,

02:15.833 --> 02:20.208
a beauty influencer
who's been trending on Instagram.

02:21.416 --> 02:23.208
Hi, I'm Rumi.

02:23.291 --> 02:26.041
I'm growing my channel,
so please subscribe!

02:26.125 --> 02:28.541
What have you planned for us today?

02:28.625 --> 02:34.125
Today, I'm using my makeup skills
to give my classmate a makeover.

02:35.750 --> 02:38.708
Let us introduce you to today's model.

02:38.791 --> 02:39.875
This way.

02:43.083 --> 02:44.958
It's Shimura!

02:45.458 --> 02:46.958
Yay!

02:47.458 --> 02:48.791
Smile for the camera.

02:49.291 --> 02:50.958
All right, cut.

02:52.666 --> 02:54.166
Hey, Shimura.

02:54.250 --> 02:56.125
Look like you're having fun.

02:56.708 --> 02:57.666
Sorry.

02:57.750 --> 02:59.541
I said I'd pay you 1,000 yen.

03:00.375 --> 03:01.708
You think this is a joke?

03:01.791 --> 03:03.375
You messing with us, punk?

03:03.875 --> 03:06.083
Okay, hold still.

03:09.833 --> 03:12.833
This is my "fun" school life.

03:14.041 --> 03:17.625
Okay, his makeup is done!

03:23.958 --> 03:26.416
Come on, guys. This is too much.

03:26.500 --> 03:27.708
You don't like it?

03:27.791 --> 03:31.083
Oh no, I think you went a bit too far.

03:31.166 --> 03:33.375
Yeah. I don't look cool at all.

03:33.458 --> 03:36.333
I laugh at things
I don't find funny at all,

03:36.833 --> 03:39.333
and nod along
to things I don't agree with.

03:40.458 --> 03:41.458
But this is fine.

03:42.416 --> 03:43.875
This is totally fine.

03:44.375 --> 03:47.958
Shimura, say hello to the viewers again.

03:48.875 --> 03:52.375
Nice to meet you. I'm Kota Shimura.

03:56.416 --> 03:58.125
This is totally fine.

04:04.416 --> 04:06.541
Why won't it come off?

04:07.791 --> 04:10.291
What am I good at?

04:11.000 --> 04:14.708
He's stupid, but has talent
for making money through streaming.

04:14.791 --> 04:17.250
That stream already made 50,000.

04:19.541 --> 04:22.208
Hey, Hamaken.

04:22.291 --> 04:24.791
She has the talent to get by
with her good looks alone.

04:24.875 --> 04:27.791
Then you can have Kanegon's share.

04:27.875 --> 04:29.083
Yeah?

04:29.166 --> 04:31.000
Sure. It's yours.

04:31.083 --> 04:32.125
Thanks!

04:32.208 --> 04:36.208
And this guy knows how to brown-nose
his way up the social ladder.

04:37.500 --> 04:40.791
But I have nothing.

04:41.416 --> 04:44.500
I'm at the very bottom
of the school's social ladder.

04:53.166 --> 04:55.250
Desperate for a mere ten yen, huh.

04:55.333 --> 04:56.958
You really are poor.

05:01.500 --> 05:03.208
About the 1,000 yen…

05:03.291 --> 05:04.166
What?

05:04.791 --> 05:07.875
You promised me 1,000 yen
if I did the makeup gig.

05:07.958 --> 05:09.333
Did I really say that?

05:09.416 --> 05:10.750
I don't know.

05:10.833 --> 05:12.750
I don't recall.

05:12.833 --> 05:13.666
You heard 'em.

05:13.750 --> 05:15.541
I only agreed because you--

05:18.375 --> 05:19.458
Shut up, loser.

05:19.541 --> 05:22.375
You can't be that desperate
for just 1,000 yen.

05:22.458 --> 05:23.666
Oh, yeah.

05:24.208 --> 05:27.166
Tell me, is your mom still alive?

05:28.541 --> 05:30.208
She's sick, isn't she?

05:31.208 --> 05:33.333
Is that why you're so poor?

05:34.458 --> 05:36.083
Hey. Let's go.

05:36.875 --> 05:37.875
That was mean.

05:38.541 --> 05:40.166
He'll do anything for money.

05:52.416 --> 05:53.250
I…

05:56.916 --> 06:00.416
I should have taken a swing at them.

06:03.125 --> 06:05.250
URABE GENERAL HOSPITAL

06:05.333 --> 06:06.916
What happened to your face?

06:07.875 --> 06:10.083
Don't tell me you got in a fight.

06:10.166 --> 06:12.833
What? No. I would never.

06:13.333 --> 06:14.250
I just tripped.

06:14.333 --> 06:16.125
Really? Alright, then.

06:16.208 --> 06:17.666
Have a sweet bun.

06:21.625 --> 06:23.458
TOTAL AMOUNT DUE: 3,140,000 YEN

06:23.541 --> 06:25.458
How's school?

06:27.208 --> 06:28.750
Yeah, it's fun.

06:29.791 --> 06:31.500
Don't worry about me.

06:32.083 --> 06:34.791
Just enjoy your high school life.

06:35.416 --> 06:37.125
You are

06:38.708 --> 06:39.833
only young once.

06:53.833 --> 06:55.583
This is my youth.

06:56.208 --> 06:58.375
I spend my days frying potatoes here.

06:58.458 --> 07:00.375
Shimura, hurry up with order 60.

07:00.458 --> 07:01.291
Yes, sir.

07:04.958 --> 07:08.500
My life is shit.

07:09.791 --> 07:10.833
Hey, everyone.

07:11.500 --> 07:13.666
Let me introduce our new crew member.

07:13.750 --> 07:16.333
Man, like we're not slammed.

07:17.833 --> 07:18.958
Nice to meet you.

07:22.125 --> 07:23.625
I'm Kaho Asamiya.

07:25.375 --> 07:28.083
Maybe I went too far calling it shit.

07:28.166 --> 07:29.625
I'm excited to start work.

07:29.708 --> 07:32.166
-If you have questions, just ask.
-Okay.

07:35.458 --> 07:36.583
Hot!

07:37.541 --> 07:41.500
Crap, I stared too long.
She must think I'm a creep.

07:43.166 --> 07:44.791
One bacon cheeseburger combo?

07:44.875 --> 07:46.375
Coming right up.

07:47.666 --> 07:49.500
Hey, Shimura. You got an order.

07:49.583 --> 07:50.708
Yes, sir.

07:51.833 --> 07:54.083
Hey guys. It's me, Hamaken,

07:54.166 --> 07:55.083
Hamaken?

07:56.250 --> 07:57.416
Why are they here?

07:57.500 --> 07:58.583
Today, we're at…

07:58.666 --> 07:59.708
Oh, crap.

08:01.791 --> 08:04.333
This is today's mission from our viewers.

08:04.416 --> 08:06.666
See if they can make
the Monster Cheeseburger

08:06.750 --> 08:07.875
in under 30 seconds.

08:08.916 --> 08:09.916
Let's see…

08:10.000 --> 08:12.625
If they fail the challenge,

08:12.708 --> 08:16.375
this cute server
has to give us her number!

08:16.458 --> 08:19.500
Excuse me,
you're bothering the other customers.

08:19.583 --> 08:22.041
I don't really want to do this either.

08:22.125 --> 08:23.958
But my viewers keep egging me on.

08:24.041 --> 08:25.916
-Thanks…
-For cooperating!

08:26.000 --> 08:27.541
I can't agree to this.

08:27.625 --> 08:28.875
Start the clock!

08:28.958 --> 08:29.833
One.

08:29.916 --> 08:32.291
-Two, three, four, five.
-Hey!

08:32.375 --> 08:34.083
Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

08:34.166 --> 08:35.958
What should we do?

08:36.041 --> 08:36.916
Beats me.

08:37.000 --> 08:39.000
-Where's the manager?
-He went out.

08:39.083 --> 08:41.041
They can't just start filming.

08:41.125 --> 08:42.500
Get them to stop.

08:43.291 --> 08:44.125
Okay.

08:44.833 --> 08:47.833
The manager is currently out and--

08:47.916 --> 08:50.166
Here's your Monster Cheeseburger.

08:54.666 --> 08:56.041
You…

08:58.791 --> 08:59.958
Come on.

09:00.458 --> 09:01.291
Let's go.

09:06.000 --> 09:06.958
They didn't realize.

09:07.458 --> 09:09.291
Thank goodness.

09:12.000 --> 09:13.958
Thank you, Shimura.

09:14.833 --> 09:17.041
Huh? How do you know my name?

09:17.916 --> 09:18.750
That.

09:18.833 --> 09:20.458
SHIMURA

09:20.541 --> 09:22.666
Oh, yeah.

09:22.750 --> 09:24.875
Crap. I'm being creepy again.

09:29.708 --> 09:30.583
But…

09:30.666 --> 09:31.708
I'm so sorry.

09:31.791 --> 09:34.250
She thanked me.

09:34.833 --> 09:36.583
Sorry for the trouble.

09:37.708 --> 09:39.083
Please enjoy your meal.

09:41.875 --> 09:43.083
She said, "Thank you."

09:47.041 --> 09:48.916
Shimura.

09:49.916 --> 09:52.416
Why the hell did you get in my way?

09:53.041 --> 09:53.875
Huh?

09:58.541 --> 09:59.833
I… I'm sorry.

09:59.916 --> 10:01.791
Sorry isn't gonna cut it.

10:04.625 --> 10:08.666
How dare you ruin my content?

10:08.750 --> 10:09.958
"Your" content?

10:10.875 --> 10:14.666
How dare you interfere
with Hamaken's content?

10:15.500 --> 10:16.375
Shimura?

10:17.250 --> 10:18.500
Are you okay?

10:18.583 --> 10:20.750
You need to watch your step.

10:21.500 --> 10:22.333
Shimura.

10:22.416 --> 10:23.791
Well, then.

10:23.875 --> 10:25.916
Good luck with work.

10:30.333 --> 10:31.708
Have a good shift.

10:35.166 --> 10:36.625
Are you okay?

10:36.708 --> 10:38.041
What about?

10:39.833 --> 10:41.333
Oh, that?

10:41.416 --> 10:44.208
It's nothing, really. I just fell.

10:44.833 --> 10:47.125
Those guys are in my class.

10:47.208 --> 10:48.625
We're friends.

10:50.166 --> 10:54.166
Lame. It's so obvious we're not friends.

10:59.416 --> 11:01.500
WHAT TIME WILL YOU BE HOME TODAY?

11:04.083 --> 11:06.458
I HAVE SELF-STUDY. I'LL BE LATE.

11:22.375 --> 11:24.208
Huh? What do you want?

11:24.708 --> 11:27.500
I am not asking for anything.
This is my seat.

11:27.583 --> 11:28.500
Move.

11:28.583 --> 11:31.375
She's so full of herself.

11:33.041 --> 11:34.416
You're coming with me.

11:34.500 --> 11:35.541
Let go of me!

11:51.166 --> 11:53.041
What a rough morning.

11:53.125 --> 11:55.083
Great job!

11:55.166 --> 11:56.750
Keep it up!

11:56.833 --> 11:58.458
Who did it?

12:02.583 --> 12:03.875
You piss me off.

12:03.958 --> 12:05.000
Hey.

12:05.083 --> 12:06.000
Gloomy-ass bitch.

12:15.166 --> 12:17.166
SCHOOL MOTTO
LET YOUR DREAMS SHINE

12:51.166 --> 12:52.583
Yeah!

12:56.666 --> 12:59.083
Bottoms up. Have some more.

13:00.791 --> 13:02.333
Hey! Seriously?

13:02.416 --> 13:05.000
Was this really just for content?

13:05.625 --> 13:07.083
Did you just want her number?

13:07.166 --> 13:08.666
DESPERATE FOR HER NUMBER LOL

13:08.750 --> 13:10.333
Course not.

13:12.375 --> 13:13.916
That's what I thought.

13:15.375 --> 13:18.125
I don't want you texting other girls.

13:18.208 --> 13:21.541
Dummy. You're the only one for me.

13:26.916 --> 13:28.000
DANDAN NOODLES

13:28.083 --> 13:29.875
Whoa! Watch out!

13:32.541 --> 13:34.666
Why is this happening?

13:34.750 --> 13:38.083
Macchi, thanks
for your 3,000 yen donation!

13:39.791 --> 13:44.375
What? Complete the next hunt
in under three minutes for 30,000 yen?

13:44.458 --> 13:47.291
You sure? That's easy-peasy for me.

13:50.208 --> 13:51.791
Sorry. It's almost ready.

13:53.625 --> 13:58.250
All the viewers saying I can't do it
better donate when I succeed!

13:58.958 --> 14:00.291
Here I go.

14:00.958 --> 14:01.791
Nice one.

14:01.875 --> 14:02.916
Why…

14:03.000 --> 14:03.833
There we go.

14:03.916 --> 14:06.000
Why did I let him into my house?

14:11.166 --> 14:14.625
I figured I'd start my own channel
and rake in the donations.

14:16.208 --> 14:17.666
But, you know…

14:18.166 --> 14:20.291
It's a pain in the ass
for minors to start one.

14:20.375 --> 14:23.458
You need a parent's bank details,
streaming account, and stuff.

14:23.958 --> 14:27.333
-Oh.
-Your mom's hospitalized, right?

14:28.500 --> 14:29.333
Yeah.

14:30.666 --> 14:32.458
You know what I'm getting at, right?

14:33.083 --> 14:38.333
He's making money using
my mom's account and bank details.

14:38.875 --> 14:40.666
I'm sorry, Mom.

14:40.750 --> 14:42.250
Yes!

14:42.333 --> 14:43.500
Here we go.

14:43.583 --> 14:45.250
Here comes my 30,000 yen!

14:46.500 --> 14:48.375
One last hit. Here we go.

14:48.458 --> 14:51.916
Three, two, one…

15:04.958 --> 15:06.416
It's hot!

15:07.666 --> 15:09.583
Whoa, sorry. Are you okay?

15:17.250 --> 15:20.333
What the hell have you done?

15:22.083 --> 15:22.916
I said I'm sorry.

15:23.500 --> 15:26.250
I was one strike away from 30,000 yen.

15:26.333 --> 15:28.541
You better pay up!

15:29.166 --> 15:31.041
That's right, you owe me!

15:31.125 --> 15:33.583
I can't just come up with 30,000 yen.

15:34.916 --> 15:36.541
Don't you dare run away!

15:39.916 --> 15:42.500
You can't because you're poor, huh?

15:48.666 --> 15:49.875
How pathetic.

15:50.375 --> 15:52.833
Why am I getting beaten up in my own home?

15:52.916 --> 15:55.083
Damn it!

15:55.833 --> 15:58.833
I knew you were a useless piece of shit!

16:04.875 --> 16:08.958
Your mom's gonna die
because you're so pathetic.

16:24.875 --> 16:26.750
Get your hand off of me!

16:26.833 --> 16:28.416
The hell are you doing?

16:37.791 --> 16:40.041
The first fist I ever raised.

16:40.125 --> 16:42.083
The first person I ever hit.

16:43.625 --> 16:47.291
Stop it! The hell's wrong with you?

16:48.333 --> 16:50.291
And his fist.

16:52.208 --> 16:53.333
You've got some nerve!

16:58.125 --> 17:02.541
Fighting wasn't
as big a deal as I thought.

17:15.541 --> 17:17.541
Ouch. That hurts.

17:26.333 --> 17:27.958
I've gotta clean

17:29.125 --> 17:30.333
this mess up.

17:36.500 --> 17:37.875
Oh, gotta save power.

18:04.875 --> 18:06.541
Immunotherapy?

18:06.625 --> 18:07.625
Yes.

18:07.708 --> 18:10.625
Keytruda is a very promising drug.

18:11.125 --> 18:14.541
I suggested it to your mother,
but she declined.

18:16.375 --> 18:20.500
Your mother always brags about you, Kota.

18:20.583 --> 18:25.333
She says you're a sweet boy
who's never gotten in a fight.

18:29.875 --> 18:31.458
Let me think about this.

18:31.958 --> 18:33.500
Yes, of course.

18:39.916 --> 18:41.291
Even though

18:41.916 --> 18:43.916
I have no idea what to do.

18:50.875 --> 18:51.958
Hello?

18:52.041 --> 18:53.125
Where the hell are you?

18:53.791 --> 18:54.625
Huh?

18:55.208 --> 18:57.083
Delete the goddamn video!

18:57.750 --> 18:58.875
What video?

18:58.958 --> 19:03.083
The livestream from yesterday
has been uploaded!

19:03.166 --> 19:04.000
What?

19:05.125 --> 19:07.791
But… I thought I pulled the plug out.

19:09.375 --> 19:10.875
Was it the monitor's power?

19:10.958 --> 19:12.750
So the computer was still on.

19:12.833 --> 19:18.333
The whole fight
was streamed from that webcam.

19:18.833 --> 19:19.916
LIVE FIGHT LOL

19:20.000 --> 19:21.416
BOTH OF THEM SUCK

19:21.500 --> 19:22.833
I'M CRYING! ROFLMAO

19:26.166 --> 19:28.375
It's got over 100,000 views.

19:29.375 --> 19:31.750
Wait a minute. I never uploaded it.

19:31.833 --> 19:34.750
Then you must have
turned off the computer.

19:34.833 --> 19:36.291
Oh, gotta save power.

19:38.833 --> 19:39.666
Oh…

19:39.750 --> 19:41.291
The video automatically uploads

19:41.375 --> 19:43.708
when the computer
is turned off mid-stream.

20:02.000 --> 20:04.208
KANEGON'S GAME STREAM, 130K VIEWS

20:04.291 --> 20:06.583
How do I delete it?

20:12.666 --> 20:14.083
NO VIDEOS UPLOADED

20:20.125 --> 20:22.625
HIGH SCHOOL

20:25.000 --> 20:28.583
I hope no one's seen it.

20:35.041 --> 20:36.916
I guess they haven't.

20:43.166 --> 20:46.291
Good morning, Mr. Viral Streamer.

20:47.833 --> 20:48.958
It's gone viral!

20:49.041 --> 20:50.458
Shimura.

20:50.541 --> 20:53.833
You should've told us
you started streaming.

20:54.333 --> 20:57.875
-Well…
-Knock it off, Hamaken.

20:57.958 --> 21:00.458
You're feeling
really embarrassed now, huh?

21:01.083 --> 21:04.916
Isn't this crazy though?
People overseas are watching it too.

21:05.000 --> 21:07.291
How did it come to this?

21:07.375 --> 21:08.666
Shimura!

21:11.833 --> 21:13.583
You little…

21:16.041 --> 21:17.041
Ouch…

21:18.416 --> 21:19.250
Yo.

21:20.750 --> 21:22.791
You're such a puny-ass twig.

21:23.458 --> 21:24.333
Hamaken?

21:24.416 --> 21:26.208
I'm not your friend.

21:27.583 --> 21:29.416
Stop joking around.

21:29.500 --> 21:32.666
I have a new idea
to make you go even more viral.

21:33.583 --> 21:34.416
I'll pass.

21:35.166 --> 21:38.250
You're pathetic, losing against
a piece of trash like Shimura.

21:39.875 --> 21:42.166
Come on. Don't say that.

21:42.666 --> 21:43.833
Aren't we friends?

21:43.916 --> 21:44.916
Friends?

21:46.750 --> 21:49.083
Give me a break.

21:49.833 --> 21:52.291
You think I'm friends with this loser?

21:55.458 --> 21:57.125
No way they're friends.

21:59.750 --> 22:02.291
Dude, they're perfect for each other.

22:08.041 --> 22:08.875
Are you okay?

22:08.958 --> 22:09.958
Shut up.

22:10.458 --> 22:14.333
You're lucky. You have nothing to lose.

22:16.583 --> 22:20.250
I worked so hard
to get in Hamaken's good graces.

22:21.500 --> 22:23.708
-Oh, well.
-Don't just shrug it off!

22:25.833 --> 22:27.875
I'm not going down like this.

22:29.250 --> 22:31.250
I'm going to climb back up.

22:34.416 --> 22:35.625
And you…

22:36.291 --> 22:37.625
You're okay with this?

22:38.375 --> 22:39.208
Huh?

22:39.291 --> 22:42.333
Are you happy being at the bottom
of the school's social hierarchy?

22:43.833 --> 22:44.958
You are

22:45.541 --> 22:47.083
only young once.

22:47.166 --> 22:50.416
Are you okay being
everyone's laughingstock?

22:53.833 --> 22:55.416
It doesn't bother me.

22:55.916 --> 22:57.916
I've come to terms with it.

22:58.416 --> 22:59.583
Acting all mature.

23:01.791 --> 23:04.708
Besides, what can I do
to change at this point?

23:16.583 --> 23:18.458
BARBER YASHIO

23:26.791 --> 23:27.625
It's cold!

23:37.875 --> 23:40.375
Aki, food's ready.

23:50.750 --> 23:51.583
Hmm?

23:52.750 --> 23:55.250
Did something good happen?

23:55.750 --> 23:56.916
No, not really.

23:58.375 --> 23:59.291
Okay.

24:07.833 --> 24:10.208
I couldn't believe it either.

24:10.291 --> 24:13.750
The duo everyone's talking about
are my classmates.

24:15.500 --> 24:16.875
What? Make them fight?

24:16.958 --> 24:20.041
I can't do that to my friends.

24:20.125 --> 24:21.458
Friends, my ass.

24:21.541 --> 24:22.750
You're so kind.

24:23.375 --> 24:26.416
Okay, now. Say hi to the viewers.

24:29.791 --> 24:32.958
Hello. Sorry for causing trouble.

24:33.041 --> 24:34.958
Alright then.

24:35.041 --> 24:38.708
They've patched things up
and are best friends now,

24:38.791 --> 24:41.208
so there's nothing to worry about.

24:42.333 --> 24:45.750
Today, to celebrate their reconciliation,

24:45.833 --> 24:49.166
we'll be giving away
the latest model computer

24:49.250 --> 24:52.041
to one lucky viewer
who likes and subscribes!

24:52.125 --> 24:54.583
It's a lie! He's lying to you!

24:54.666 --> 24:59.041
There are no sweepstakes or giveaways.
He'll never give away a computer!

25:01.833 --> 25:03.958
Hamaken is a fraud.

25:04.041 --> 25:04.958
Huh?

25:05.041 --> 25:09.541
All those giveaways are lies.
He just says that to get more subscribers.

25:10.041 --> 25:12.125
He's never given anything away.

25:12.208 --> 25:14.500
Hamaken is a filthy fraud.

25:15.125 --> 25:18.291
He promised me 1,000 yen
but I never got paid.

25:18.375 --> 25:21.666
Let's expose him.

25:22.166 --> 25:23.833
He acts nice on camera,

25:24.416 --> 25:28.250
but he's a good-for-nothing delinquent
who beats us up off camera.

25:28.333 --> 25:30.541
What the hell are you saying?

25:30.625 --> 25:33.208
Hamaken is responsible for my bruises.

25:43.541 --> 25:44.708
You idiot.

25:45.750 --> 25:48.375
We stopped streaming a while ago.

25:52.041 --> 25:54.333
Who you calling a fraud?

25:57.625 --> 25:58.500
Hey.

26:02.791 --> 26:03.791
Hey.

26:06.125 --> 26:08.208
It's Hamaken. Let's go.

26:08.291 --> 26:09.916
Hamaken's fighting.

26:10.000 --> 26:10.833
Really?

26:11.666 --> 26:13.166
Trying to expose me?

26:13.250 --> 26:15.000
Trying to take revenge?

26:23.333 --> 26:24.666
-Hey!
-Ow!

26:25.916 --> 26:26.916
Expose him?

26:27.541 --> 26:28.458
On his channel?

26:28.541 --> 26:31.166
No. On ours.

26:32.291 --> 26:34.583
-Huh?
-We're minor celebrities now.

26:34.666 --> 26:36.791
This exposé video will go viral.

26:40.208 --> 26:43.333
-No way. He'll just beat me up again.
-Money.

26:45.375 --> 26:46.958
Don't you want money?

26:50.333 --> 26:52.041
Guess I have no other choice.

26:54.250 --> 26:55.916
If we can expose him,

26:57.416 --> 26:58.833
I'll pay you 10,000 yen.

26:58.916 --> 27:00.583
Hey! Get up!

27:00.666 --> 27:02.166
I said, get up!

27:02.750 --> 27:03.708
Let's go see it.

27:03.791 --> 27:05.000
Who picked a fight?

27:05.541 --> 27:06.875
No way, with Hamaken?

27:06.958 --> 27:07.958
That's crazy.

27:14.916 --> 27:16.916
Don't you ever mess with me again.

27:22.375 --> 27:23.208
Huh?

27:24.500 --> 27:25.625
Money…

27:27.750 --> 27:30.750
You owe me… 1,000 yen.

27:31.583 --> 27:32.708
What's up with you?

27:34.416 --> 27:35.250
Hmm?

27:35.958 --> 27:38.500
Want me to beat you to a pulp? Huh?

27:39.000 --> 27:42.125
Fine by me, you piece of shit.

27:42.708 --> 27:44.083
Who's being so loud?

27:54.208 --> 27:55.041
You?

27:56.166 --> 27:57.000
No…

27:57.583 --> 27:59.083
Keep it down.

27:59.166 --> 28:00.000
I can't nap.

28:01.666 --> 28:03.333
Sure thing.

28:12.333 --> 28:13.166
Hey.

28:14.791 --> 28:15.625
Hey!

28:24.500 --> 28:25.958
Ow, it hurts…

28:27.083 --> 28:28.416
You're alive.

28:30.083 --> 28:31.708
How did I get here?

28:32.208 --> 28:34.000
Ogi, from the class next door.

28:35.916 --> 28:37.166
Ogi carried me?

28:39.250 --> 28:40.791
Tatsuya Ogi.

28:41.291 --> 28:44.375
A guy who exists outside
the school's social ladder.

28:44.875 --> 28:48.375
A high schooler who's a rising star
in the world of MMA.

28:48.875 --> 28:51.916
So what happened with the exposé video?

28:54.791 --> 28:56.708
You trying to take revenge?

29:02.250 --> 29:03.625
It's gone viral.

29:03.708 --> 29:06.166
Yeah, the exposé was a success.

29:06.250 --> 29:07.583
So I'll get 10,000--

29:07.666 --> 29:09.208
Sorry. I can't pay you.

29:09.291 --> 29:11.916
What? Why not? We made a deal.

29:12.000 --> 29:14.458
You didn't last long. That's on you.

29:14.958 --> 29:15.916
What?

29:16.000 --> 29:19.083
Short videos don't generate money.

29:19.166 --> 29:21.250
Plus, ad revenue is declining.

29:21.750 --> 29:25.125
That's why we've gotta go after donations.

29:25.875 --> 29:26.875
Donations…

29:26.958 --> 29:29.958
Even with donations,
you can earn more with longer videos,

29:30.041 --> 29:33.541
but you still don't get the full amount.

29:33.625 --> 29:37.416
After all the fees,
we're left with about 60 percent.

29:37.500 --> 29:38.833
In this case…

29:40.125 --> 29:41.208
That's 3,900 yen.

29:41.291 --> 29:43.625
3,900 yen? After all that effort?

29:43.708 --> 29:45.791
It's because the video was short.

29:45.875 --> 29:48.208
And we're still a small channel.

29:48.291 --> 29:50.000
I had no idea…

29:53.000 --> 29:54.458
Hold on a second.

29:54.541 --> 29:57.250
That doesn't concern me.
Pay me the 10,000 yen.

29:57.333 --> 29:58.708
I'm asking

29:59.375 --> 30:02.541
if you're happy settling
for a measly 10,000 yen.

30:04.125 --> 30:06.750
This video's already reached
over a million views.

30:06.833 --> 30:08.708
We'll get more subscribers.

30:08.791 --> 30:12.958
If we can stream for longer,
making millions won't be a dream.

30:17.708 --> 30:18.791
Did you know?

30:19.416 --> 30:23.333
Some people make
200 million yen from a single stream.

30:23.416 --> 30:24.583
200 million?

30:24.666 --> 30:25.666
200 million.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.458
And yet, you…

30:32.166 --> 30:33.000
Hey.

30:35.458 --> 30:36.291
Shimura?

30:38.333 --> 30:39.458
Hey, you listening?

30:39.541 --> 30:41.500
Oh, uh… Sorry.

30:42.458 --> 30:44.666
What's wrong with you? You're creepy.

30:47.375 --> 30:51.541
But what could we possibly do
in a live stream?

30:57.583 --> 30:58.875
Fights?

30:58.958 --> 31:02.041
That's right.
Our main content will be fights.

31:02.125 --> 31:04.708
-Wait a minute.
-We'll fight delinquents live.

31:04.791 --> 31:06.125
But, fights are--

31:06.208 --> 31:09.291
Prank videos and exposés
are all about the ideas.

31:09.375 --> 31:10.375
Of course, but…

31:10.458 --> 31:12.666
My theory has been confirmed.

31:12.750 --> 31:15.625
A wimp challenging a bully is buzz-worthy.

31:16.958 --> 31:18.041
You owe me…

31:18.958 --> 31:20.375
1,000 yen.

31:24.583 --> 31:26.041
We'll be a team.

31:27.458 --> 31:30.083
Starting today, I'm your producer.

31:30.166 --> 31:33.250
We'll stream the next video right away
and rake in donations.

31:34.375 --> 31:36.875
Let's take over the world
with this channel.

31:43.416 --> 31:45.708
I'll have you rolling in cash.

31:50.166 --> 31:51.083
Rolling?

31:55.250 --> 31:56.375
So that's that.

31:57.208 --> 32:01.125
I need you to be able to drag it out
no matter what.

32:14.250 --> 32:16.083
Wow. Looks amazing!

32:16.166 --> 32:19.416
How much longer are you gonna take?

32:21.125 --> 32:22.416
Hey…

32:26.458 --> 32:28.416
You need to go slow.

32:29.333 --> 32:30.833
C'mon, not today.

32:31.416 --> 32:33.041
Quit stalling, will you?

32:33.541 --> 32:34.375
Huh?

32:36.541 --> 32:37.500
What the…

32:38.708 --> 32:40.083
Hey, hey!

32:42.416 --> 32:43.250
Get up.

32:43.791 --> 32:45.916
Those shitheads…

32:46.000 --> 32:48.583
POPULAR STREAMER HAMAKEN
IS A TEENAGE DELINQUENT!

32:55.958 --> 32:59.666
How to drag it out, huh?

33:07.708 --> 33:09.958
HOW TO FIGHT BETTER

33:12.750 --> 33:15.791
STRENGTH TRAINING
TO IMPROVE FIGHTING

33:17.833 --> 33:19.500
GET STRONGER
WITH MARTIAL ARTS

33:19.583 --> 33:20.666
Right.

33:20.750 --> 33:22.000
JOIN A MARTIAL ARTS GYM

33:22.083 --> 33:23.875
BOXING VIDEO

33:30.375 --> 33:33.291
I would die if I did this.

33:33.375 --> 33:34.416
That's it.

33:35.958 --> 33:38.125
I'm not cut out for this.

33:38.625 --> 33:41.583
Why am I the only one who gets beaten up?

33:41.666 --> 33:42.833
That's messed up.

33:45.458 --> 33:46.875
YOU'RE BRAVE, SHIMURA

33:49.250 --> 33:52.375
"How_to_fight"?

33:53.041 --> 33:53.875
What's this?

33:59.416 --> 34:00.708
VIEWS: 0

34:00.791 --> 34:02.708
So nobody's watched it?

34:15.375 --> 34:17.375
FIGHTING MINDSET
0 VIEWS

34:48.416 --> 34:49.375
TOU-KEI

34:54.250 --> 34:57.833
Hello guys. I'm TOU-KEI.

34:57.916 --> 35:00.458
I'll teach you how to get stronger.

35:00.541 --> 35:02.916
Why a rooster?

35:03.000 --> 35:05.125
Want to know how to get stronger?

35:05.208 --> 35:09.750
It's simple. Just be my friend.

35:09.833 --> 35:11.208
Not Japanese?

35:11.291 --> 35:15.666
I'll teach you everything
you need to know, step-by-step.

35:16.666 --> 35:20.208
There's a secret to winning a fight.

35:20.291 --> 35:21.166
Huh?

35:21.250 --> 35:25.125
And I'm about to teach it to you.

35:25.708 --> 35:27.125
-But first…
-Really?

35:27.208 --> 35:29.833
…let's talk about the fighting mindset.

35:30.416 --> 35:31.916
Step one--

35:35.083 --> 35:37.583
He's definitely nuts.

35:39.333 --> 35:41.083
This is hopeless.

35:41.875 --> 35:43.708
Hey guys. It's me, Hamaken.

35:43.791 --> 35:48.000
Today, I'm asking girls enjoying
the nightlife about their dark pasts.

35:48.833 --> 35:50.666
Hey ladies.

35:50.750 --> 35:52.708
Tell me about your dark past.

35:52.791 --> 35:53.916
It's Hamaken.

35:54.000 --> 35:54.958
Oh, hell no.

35:55.041 --> 35:56.375
HOW'S THE BACKLASH?

35:56.458 --> 35:57.666
THE AUDACITY!

35:57.750 --> 35:59.000
Don't film us.

35:59.083 --> 36:00.333
You brute!

36:06.250 --> 36:07.791
I'm not feeling it today.

36:07.875 --> 36:09.458
Might as well have a drink.

36:12.041 --> 36:13.291
No high schoolers.

36:13.375 --> 36:14.250
You always…

36:14.333 --> 36:16.541
-Get out!
-Let go of me!

36:17.625 --> 36:19.000
Get your boss out here.

36:19.916 --> 36:21.041
Hey, Rumi!

36:21.125 --> 36:21.958
See ya.

36:22.041 --> 36:24.041
Rumi. Hey!

36:24.125 --> 36:25.500
Let me go!

36:43.541 --> 36:48.000
Ask him if she's still well and alive.

36:48.083 --> 36:51.625
I suggested it to your mother,
but she declined.

36:53.583 --> 36:55.875
I'll have you rolling in cash.

37:02.666 --> 37:04.791
Aren't you lonely by yourself?

37:04.875 --> 37:05.791
No way!

37:05.875 --> 37:08.083
Don't you want to become stronger?

37:08.583 --> 37:12.000
Be my friend, and I'll make you stronger.

37:12.083 --> 37:12.916
What the heck?

37:13.000 --> 37:15.875
Become stronger,
and you can change your world.

37:15.958 --> 37:17.291
Get lost!

37:29.416 --> 37:30.250
Huh?

37:31.375 --> 37:32.416
Money…

37:34.208 --> 37:37.708
You owe me… 1,000 yen.

37:39.250 --> 37:40.500
What the hell?

37:41.791 --> 37:44.125
Want me to beat you to a pulp? Huh?

37:45.583 --> 37:48.208
Fine by me, you piece of shit.

38:15.375 --> 38:16.708
Outta my way!

38:19.083 --> 38:20.416
Shimura! This is bad!

38:20.500 --> 38:21.791
Shimura!

38:21.875 --> 38:22.833
Hey!

38:22.916 --> 38:24.208
Come with me!

38:26.625 --> 38:27.666
That way.

38:27.750 --> 38:30.166
Where the hell do you think you're going?

38:33.083 --> 38:34.708
You're fucking dead!

38:37.708 --> 38:38.791
Get outta the way!

38:38.875 --> 38:40.375
Hey.

38:40.458 --> 38:41.416
It's a fight!

38:41.500 --> 38:44.333
-Who?
-Hamaken. He's super pissed!

38:46.458 --> 38:47.333
Hey!

38:53.666 --> 38:55.416
That was an accident.

38:55.500 --> 38:59.833
Acting all cocky even though you're weak.

39:03.750 --> 39:05.041
I'll kill you!

39:07.041 --> 39:08.416
You piece of shit!

39:09.875 --> 39:11.000
Stop it, Hamaken!

39:14.625 --> 39:16.666
I'll expose you on my stream again!

39:17.625 --> 39:19.791
Expose me? How?

39:19.875 --> 39:20.875
Huh?

39:20.958 --> 39:22.000
Yo!

39:34.708 --> 39:37.375
I'll make sure you never defy me again.

39:37.458 --> 39:38.458
You hear me?

39:39.041 --> 39:41.041
Don't you dare run away.

39:43.375 --> 39:45.958
You're just a piece of trash!

39:46.750 --> 39:48.166
Hey.

39:48.250 --> 39:49.291
Hey!

39:51.166 --> 39:54.958
You're nothing but lowlife.
How dare you defy me?

40:01.333 --> 40:04.458
You need to spend the rest of your life
crawling on the ground!

40:14.666 --> 40:17.291
Stop. Don't look at me.

40:19.708 --> 40:21.750
Please don't look this way.

40:27.500 --> 40:29.000
Don't worry. I've got it.

40:34.833 --> 40:35.708
Come on.

40:37.833 --> 40:39.333
Give me your phone!

40:39.416 --> 40:40.416
Huh? Why?

40:40.500 --> 40:41.625
Seriously?

40:41.708 --> 40:43.666
This isn't gonna be a typical day.

40:43.750 --> 40:45.958
Listen carefully.

40:46.541 --> 40:48.750
They're gonna take away my phone.

40:48.833 --> 40:50.416
We'll make the first move.

40:50.500 --> 40:51.750
I don't understand.

40:51.833 --> 40:53.583
I'm saying this is our chance.

40:54.166 --> 40:55.000
Our chance?

40:56.500 --> 40:58.458
To make a fortune.

41:03.833 --> 41:04.750
Hey.

41:04.833 --> 41:07.458
Keep your head down
for the rest of your life.

41:23.958 --> 41:26.583
I don't care about
being at the top or bottom.

41:31.208 --> 41:32.458
All I need

41:33.583 --> 41:35.208
is money.

41:38.041 --> 41:41.083
The underdog bites back at the bully.

41:42.000 --> 41:44.416
That's what's gonna make us rich, right?

41:59.083 --> 42:00.041
VIEWS: 1

42:27.625 --> 42:29.500
Come at me.

42:30.375 --> 42:32.083
You piece of shit.

42:47.125 --> 42:53.375
VIRAL HIT

44:11.875 --> 44:14.958
Subtitle translation by:
Kanako Connie Takahashi
